                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "assertion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dab2e479-1b2d-3144-915c-8e792d415f21",
                                        "entry_id": "5d881612-7c5e-3f12-a199-e8d25a60e6a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of asserting; positive declaration or averment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d204c109-2286-3749-bb35-452863242bf6",
                                        "entry_id": "5d881612-7c5e-3f12-a199-e8d25a60e6a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something which is asserted; a declaration; a statement asserted."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "416056ae-a017-4614-acdf-c1af0e682a47",
                                                "sense_id": "d204c109-2286-3749-bb35-452863242bf6",
                                                "text": "You're a man of strong assertions!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af66a702-bf37-464a-a903-2c57213037a5",
                                                "sense_id": "d204c109-2286-3749-bb35-452863242bf6",
                                                "text": "Suppose you are given the semifactual assertion, \"even if Nora had liked mathematics then she would have became^([sic]) a scientist\" and then you find out that Nora did in fact become a scientist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "197549a5-7c1a-3bd6-be7e-53586e8f39c4",
                                        "entry_id": "5d881612-7c5e-3f12-a199-e8d25a60e6a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A statement or declaration which lacks support or evidence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "120c76aa-6503-41da-9e74-c8f1f935728a",
                                                "sense_id": "197549a5-7c1a-3bd6-be7e-53586e8f39c4",
                                                "text": "That's just a bare assertion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a5dfda5-691b-4aea-8306-7cefef93db49",
                                                "sense_id": "197549a5-7c1a-3bd6-be7e-53586e8f39c4",
                                                "text": "Drivers' union ASLEF bluntly rebuffed the claim of unofficial action, calling it a lie. And Avanti West Coast was unable to provide any proof for its assertion, when questioned by RAIL."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e7dd9f7-52c5-334c-a5aa-9c2b95653b5c",
                                        "entry_id": "5d881612-7c5e-3f12-a199-e8d25a60e6a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Maintenance; vindication"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01284959-b39c-4cf2-afb4-32cf40065fad",
                                                "sense_id": "1e7dd9f7-52c5-334c-a5aa-9c2b95653b5c",
                                                "text": "the assertion of one's rights or prerogatives"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16bd5c75-fa92-3f50-bbb9-9aae453c36b7",
                                        "entry_id": "5d881612-7c5e-3f12-a199-e8d25a60e6a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A statement in a program asserting a condition expected to be true at a particular point, used in debugging."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3c1c824-9bc5-4884-8933-f5d7d2f43cde",
                                                "sense_id": "16bd5c75-fa92-3f50-bbb9-9aae453c36b7",
                                                "text": "The user should be absolutely confident that the error issued is a real design error. In other words, a user should be confident that his assertion code is correct and that the assertion failure is not a false condition."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d601b1d-76f4-340b-8275-69202374a3b1",
                                        "entry_id": "5d881612-7c5e-3f12-a199-e8d25a60e6a9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "the set of information that the statement preparer is providing in a financial statement audit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f703e733-bd5f-4554-b902-db3065ad54d4",
                        "source_entry_id": "5e80064a-0a49-34b1-b0e5-b60aad60b3ba",
                        "source_sense_id": "a4ead664-e840-3268-ae7f-35306447301c",
                        "target_lang_word": "assertion",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "assertion",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b1442d7-4b8e-3593-9b97-b59150240b74",
                                        "entry_id": "39559601-3d5a-3f77-ae95-f05d1cdd32a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Proposition qu’on avance et qu’on soutient comme vraie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rhetoric"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "057ff551-e790-4cde-a75a-0aa56104084b",
                                                "sense_id": "0b1442d7-4b8e-3593-9b97-b59150240b74",
                                                "text": "Nous prîmes d’abord le mot pour une saillie du spirituel humoriste ; mais, plus tard, en y réfléchissant, la vérité de cette assertion bizarre nous fut démontrée complétement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8b68881-f436-44a9-b398-e2f28c060957",
                                                "sense_id": "0b1442d7-4b8e-3593-9b97-b59150240b74",
                                                "text": "Telle assertion, émanant de certains spécialistes, paraîtra inacceptable à d'autres."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "626f37cd-98b6-4b47-92ae-3ce2cc58d1ac",
                                                "sense_id": "0b1442d7-4b8e-3593-9b97-b59150240b74",
                                                "text": "La religiosité, […], remplace donc la religion au Morvan, du moins d'après quelques écrivains. Apportent-ils la preuve de cette assertion, […]? Nullement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2078a853-c291-4e28-937a-a2d5f3bf641e",
                                                "sense_id": "0b1442d7-4b8e-3593-9b97-b59150240b74",
                                                "text": "Combault réfutant l’assertion du tribunal, qu’il y avait dans l’Internationale des chefs et des dirigés dit : « Chacun de nous est libre et agit librement ; il n’y a aucune pression de pensée, entre les Internationaux... »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6185a196-c1b9-447f-8eaa-e8774011869b",
                                                "sense_id": "0b1442d7-4b8e-3593-9b97-b59150240b74",
                                                "text": "Eh bien, j'ai le plaisir, preuve à l'appui, de m'inscrire en faux contre cette maligne assertion. Ceux qui l'affirment, l'assènent à tout bout de champ, le proclament à l'envi ont la langue plus fourchue que vipère aspic, ils galèjent mieux que Marseillais à la pétanque, ils ne sont que vils baratineurs, ils mythonent, pipeautent, racontent des craques ou accrochent des paletots."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "abb9f41b-4ddf-3dc4-936e-087d43e31a42",
                                        "entry_id": "39559601-3d5a-3f77-ae95-f05d1cdd32a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Proposition mathématique vraie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
